{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The perimeter of a semicircular region, measured in centimeters, is numerically equal to its area, measured in square centimeters. The radius of the semicircle, measured in centimeters, is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77ad3e384d4bfe2999fdfb26f03b876820bcb40d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ \\pi \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)} \\ \\frac{2}{\\pi} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)} \\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)} \\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ \\frac{4}{\\pi}+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"400\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the radius of the semicircle.  Then its perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/9/a099980067a9693158e08fca075dbf12489b7478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r + \\pi r = r(2 + \\pi)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" />, while its area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/6207302ed3691f5763b72e7c357a71d2549262d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\pi r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" />.  So:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/b/18b676bc9e5455ef3c4b6f304b41b05c9c538089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r(2 + \\pi) = \\frac{1}{2}\\pi r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/e/8bea14a6505871f85d84cf68ce2562856c924a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + \\pi = \\frac{1}{2}\\pi r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e24be621f46e5d47598636743f143aee8c89ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{2}{\\pi}(2 + \\pi) = \\boxed{(\\mathbf{E})\\ \\frac{4}{\\pi} + 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"222\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</t